<title>USA: Discount Auto sees freon sales slowdown.</title>
<headline>Discount Auto sees freon sales slowdown.</headline>
<dateline>LAKELAND, Fla. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discount Auto Parts Inc said Wednesday it expects lower commercial sales of its R-12 freon that could hurt its earnings for at least the third and fourth quarters of its 1997 fiscal year.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said overall sales would also be affected and its financial results can be expected to be lower than current analysts' expectations.</p>
</text>
